{
  "_comment": "Amazon Vigil - 10 Baseline Scenarios (SPEC.md Section 3). Ingest triad symbols and expected outcomes are canonical; `score` seeds the deterministic edge path, `signals` carry the discrete override/corroboration indicators, `mode` is the operational mode implied by host state. Phase 8 - tasks.md Task 8.1.",
